{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>RecipePocket 是一款專為網上食譜而設的收藏工具，讓你透過 iOS 分享選單，把瀏覽器或其他應用程式中的食譜儲存起來，自動整理標題、圖片、材料與步驟。適合經常在網上找食譜、希望集中管理的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線收藏食譜與購物清單</h2>\n<p>RecipePocket 透過 iOS 分享選單儲存網頁食譜，自動擷取標題、圖片、材料與步驟。你可按標題、材料或標籤搜尋，自行分類並標記最愛，也能加入個人筆記。材料可一鍵加入購物清單，重複項目自動合併並按貨架分類。烹調模式提供大字體步驟與打勾功能，螢幕保持長亮。應用可離線使用，並經個人 iCloud 私人同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-222-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-223-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-224-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-225-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-226-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-227-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：RecipePocket</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T23:58:29.495857+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}